71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x6msnmnlZ-QQ7kNvwERdKEY&_nc_oc=Adrv0oEoHsi60t_pctpqCJFoZz9csS0DAoeq4ffiZ_-FfrRoX4cmgNKXmxwvdOhFkFY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_0RGX28EsrzkXMSxHfKOs8u4vLtwDG1iJSIbDqkgoRzw&oe=6A296239"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F8UdcHxeZzEQ7kNvwGFy_-F&_nc_oc=Adoju-Y58fqn4RmBxmjwexKzXdiyTbETe4DIikpTp2yxuEgkNFPTj9utTxLDjJ3V-R4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-IOSj3kYauP4miLR9aKXWO_I3JaOoJ4ixGtnyn7cd0mw&oe=6A297513"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SO2nX6e5TUsQ7kNvwH2msyA&_nc_oc=AdrVieCP_klmuonPUTe0RsCliT6wg7XaMY7Cn9lMC9DTFQ4R4xnuUq0MkLSMKe8X3g4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_seytVUB8o2bIDqx3YTB-AjBwXiS36-p7NpQvTVrztIg&oe=6A29735A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: